From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PS5 Mesa port <ps5-mesa@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 19:23:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] egl: the "videoout" platform, EGL on a VK_KHR_display through
 zink

OpenGL and OpenGL ES on a display without a window system, such as the
PlayStation 5's: -Dplatforms=videoout, -Degl-native-platform=videoout.
eglGetDisplay(EGL_DEFAULT_DISPLAY) and any non-zero native window; window
surfaces are kopper drawables on the display (BGRA8888/BGRX8888 configs),
pbuffers are as on surfaceless. Nothing in it is console-specific: it runs
wherever zink's Vulkan driver has VK_KHR_display (on Linux, RADV's PS5 host
model).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014ZqjJDSiP9GQFUidfnxiHF
